  <h1 class="article-title">Dr. Lars von Kolzenberg</h1>
  <div class="prose">
    <p>I model batteries from first principles. My PhD at Ulm University was on the SEI: how it grows, and what happens to it on silicon particles that swell and crack. Since then I've worked wherever batteries meet software, from aging analysis to cell design and swelling. Today I'm Principal Battery Model Developer at Breathe.</p>
    <p>Charge Tanks is where I write down, from scratch, how I think about cells.</p>
  </div>
